# Line endings are normalised to LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout converts sources to CRLF, and `cargo fmt
# --check` fails against rustfmt.toml's `newline_style = "Unix"` — which is how
# this was found.
#
# Note this is about *repository* files. It has nothing to do with the line
# endings Cairn preserves in a system hosts file: those are read as raw bytes at
# runtime and adopted as found (research R6).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, and not to be touched.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.db binary
